# Pre-wiring (bootstrap) behavior: builtin-type-of returns the unknown sentinel (empty Dict)
# for all values because type_val wiring has not yet been implemented (T-2110).
# builtin-has-key? "Repr" on an empty Dict returns Int(0) — no TypeValue.Repr present.
# This test documents the current state. The aspirational post-wiring test was removed
# until T-2110 (wire type_val for runtime Value variants) is implemented.
[
  int-repr:    [builtin-has-key? "Repr" [builtin-type-of 42]]
  float-repr:  [builtin-has-key? "Repr" [builtin-type-of 1.5]]
  string-repr: [builtin-has-key? "Repr" [builtin-type-of "hello"]]
]
=== out
Dict({"int-repr": Int(0), "float-repr": Int(0), "string-repr": Int(0)})
